1 NAME Karl Kristiernsson /(Vasa)/
2 GIVN Karl Kristiernsson
2 _MARNM (Vasa)
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE AFT 1390
1 DEAT
2 DATE 8 AUG 1440
