2 CONT
2 CONT Swedish prince. He was known in Swedish as Bengt and a member of the Bielbo Dynasty as a son of Princess Ingiburga and Duke Birger of Sweden. He became Duke of Finland in 1284 and Bishop of Linköping two years later. The location 
2 CONC of his grave is unknown. This is to document the bust of him which has been assumed to have been mounted earlier in Skara Cathedral and now is in West Gothland Museum in Skara.
2 CONT --------------------
