1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Ingeborg Ivarsdotter==
2 CONT
2 CONT * Daughter of Ivar Nilsson (Ivar Nilssons ätt) and Margareta Tordsdotter Bonde 
2 CONT * Birth: 1380 in halland, Åre Municipality, Jamtland County, Sweden
2 CONT * Death:	July 26, 1466 (86)
2 CONT * Place of Burial: Gammelby kirke, Denmark
2 CONT
2 CONT ==Spouse==
2 CONT
