2 CONT
2 CONT * Gustaf Elgenstierna , The introduced genealogical tables of the Swedish nobility. 1925-36. Older Swedish salvation families. Published by the Knight's House Directorate. (ÄSF). Jan Raneke, Swedish Medieval Arms.
