1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Gamle Niels Friis af Hesselager''' was born circa 1337 in Lundbygård, Lundby, Svendborg, Denmark. His parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-9277688 Henrik Jensen Friis, af Lundby] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-9277724 
2 CONC Anne Nielsdatter  Rud]. He was a Selvejer. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Niels married [https://www.geni.com/profile-9278226 Tove Nielsdatter Bild, til Lundby] circa 1379. Together they had the following children:
2 CONT * 1375 [https://www.geni.com/profile-9278380 Christiern Nielsen Friis af Hesselager, til Lundby]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on August 29, 1385 in Lundby and was buried in Gråbrødre Kirke, Odense, Denmark. 
2 CONT ----
2 CONT ---- Forseglede 1380 til vitterlighed, da Hartvig Hummersbüttel solgte Lykkesholm til Fikke Moltke og fører af Egern i sit segl.
2 CONT
2 CONT Kaldet, "Gamle Niels Friis".
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
