2 CONT
2 CONT * 2nd Son of Earl Bengt Folkesson Snivel (Folkunga) and Sigrid Björnsdotter Lakman 
2 CONT * The Swedish Biographical Dictionary (SBL), and the Swedish Diplomatarium's main catalog of medieval letters call him Magnus' memorial shield. Even Dick Harrison mentions him as Magnus Memory Shield. In Äldre Västgötalagen's lagm
2 CONC anslängd, the nickname is written in one place Minneskioldz , in another minniskiolz .
2 CONT
2 CONT ==[https://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/SWEDISH%20NOBILITY.htm#BirgerBrosadied1202 Project MedLands, Sweden Nobility]
2 CONT
2 CONT '''MAGNUS "Minnesköld" (-killed in battle near Lena 31 Jan 1208).  At Bjälbo.'''  “…B. dux…M. frater ducis B et filius eius Eskillus…” witnessed a charter dated to [1167/99] under which “Kanutus…Sweorum rex” donated property to th
2 CONC e monks of Juleta kloster[31].  “Byrgo Sweorum et Guttorum dux…Philippus frater meus, Magnus et Karolus fratres ducis…” witnessed a charter dated to [1167/99] under which “K…Sweorum rex filius Herjcjs itjdem regis” donated propert
2 CONC y to Nydala kloster[32].  '''married firstly  ?.  The name of Magnus´s first wife is not known.  married secondly INGRID [Ylva]''' 
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Magnus & his first wife had four children:'''
2 CONT
2 CONT * a)         '''ESKIL Magnusson''' (-[1227]).  “…B. dux…M. frater ducis B et filius eius Eskillus…” witnessed a charter dated to [1167/99] under which “Kanutus…Sweorum rex” donated property to the monks of Juleta kloster[33].  Lag
2 CONC mand in Västergötland 1219/20.  '''married  (1217) as her second husband, KIRSTIN Nilsdotter,''' widow of HAAKON "Gallin" Jarl in Norway, daughter of NILS Blaka & his wife Katharina Eriksdotter of Sweden (-1254).
2 CONT
2 CONT * b)         [34] '''daughter''''  '''married SIGTRYGG Bengtson [Boberg] (-after 1219).''' 
2 CONT
2 CONT * c)         '''KARL Magnusson''' (-killed in battle Rotala, Estonia 8 Aug 1220).  Bishop of Linköping.  Chancellor of Sweden. 
2 CONT
2 CONT * d)         '''ELOF Magnusson''' (-bur Alvästra Abbey).  1253/68  ''married ?''  (-bur Alvästra Abbey). 
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Magnus & his second wife INGRID Ylva had two children'''
2 CONT
2 CONT * e)         '''BENGT Magnusson''' (-4 Jan 1237).  Bishop of Linköping 1220.  m ---.  The name of Bengt´s wife is not known.  
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Bengt & his unknown wife had one child:''' 
2 CONT
2 CONT >>>>>>>>>i)          '''MAGNUS Bengtsson''' (-1263).  Lagmand in Östergötland.  '''married RAGNHILD,''' daughter of (-1262).
2 CONT
2 CONT * f)          '''BIRGER Magnusson''' ([1200]-20/21 Oct 1266, bur Varnhem Abbey).  The Icelandic Annals record that "dominus Birgerus Magni filius" was made "comes in Svecia" in 1248[35].  Jarl at Bjälbo.  Regent of Sweden.  Founde
2 CONC r of Stockholm. 
2 CONT
