2 CONT Rixa von Werle
2 CONT
2 CONT F, #5343, d. 26 November 1317
2 CONT
2 CONT Last Edited=9 Feb 2003
2 CONT
2 CONT      Rixa von Werle was the daughter of Heinrich I Prinz von Werle and Rixa (?). She married Albrecht II Herzog von Braunschweig-Göttingen, son of Albrecht I Herzog von Braunschweig and Adelheid de Montferrat, on 10 January 1284. 
2 CONC She died on 26 November 1317.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Rixa von Werle and Albrecht II Herzog von Braunschweig-Göttingen
2 CONT
2 CONT Bruno von Braunschweig-Göttingen d. 31 Aug 1303
2 CONT
2 CONT Adelheid von Braunschweig d. c 1311
2 CONT
2 CONT Maud von Braunschweig-Göttingen d. a 1 Jun 1356
2 CONT
2 CONT Otto Herzog von Braunschweig+ b. b 24 Jun 1292, d. 30 Aug 1344
2 CONT
2 CONT Albrecht von Braunschweig b. c 1294, d. 13 Oct 1359
2 CONT
2 CONT Wilhelm von Braunschweig b. c 1295, d. b 1318
2 CONT
2 CONT Heinrich von Braunschweig-Göttingen b. c 1296, d. 6 Feb 1363
2 CONT
2 CONT Richenza von Braunschweig b. c 1298, d. b 26 Apr 1317
2 CONT
2 CONT Magnus I Herzog von Braunschweig+ b. c 1304, d. c Jul 1369
2 CONT
2 CONT Ernst Herzog von Braunschweig-Göttingen+ b. c 1305, d. 24 Apr 1367
2 CONT
2 CONT Luther von Braunschweig-Göttingen b. 1307, d. 1319
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Rixa of Werle (died: 26 November 1317) was the only daughter of Lord Henry I of Werle and his wife Rikissa Birgersdotter. Rikissa was a daughter of Birger Magnusson of Bjälbo and his first wife Ingeborg.
2 CONT
2 CONT Rixa of Werle married on 10 January 1284 with Duke Albert II of Brunswick-Wolfenbüttel.
2 CONT
