2 CONT
2 CONT http://finnholbek.dk/getperson.php?personID=I8686&tree=2
2 CONT
2 CONT Valdemar married Sofia of Denmark (d. 1286) in 1260 and separated in 1277. He had six children:
2 CONT
2 CONT Ingeborg Valdemarsdotter of Sweden (1263–1292), countess of Holstein, spouse of Gerhard II of Holstein.
2 CONT
2 CONT Ingeborg VALDEMARSDOTTER (FOLKUNGA) PRINCES OF SWEDEN     
2 CONT
2 CONT Ingeborg was born about 1261 in Of, Nykoping, Sodermanland, Sweden.  She died about 1290.
2 CONT
2 CONT Gerhard II Count Of HOLSTEIN & Ingeborg VALDEMARSDOTTER (FOLKUNGA) PRINCES OF SWEDEN     
2 CONT
2 CONT Gerhard II Count Of and Ingeborg were married in a religious ceremony on December 10th, 1275.  They had two sons and a daughter, named Gerhard V Count Of, Waldemar Count Of and Elisabeth (Katharine) Countess Of.
2 CONT
2 CONT Personal Details
2 CONT
2 CONT Children
2 CONT
2 CONT   Elisabeth (Katharine) Countess Of HOLSTEIN
2 CONT
2 CONT Elisabeth (Katharine) Countess Of was born in 1276 in Of Plhon, Schleswig-Holstein, Prussia.  Her burial was in Sw. Maria, Szczecin, Szczecin, Poland.
2 CONT
2 CONT   Gerhard V Count Of HOLSTEIN
2 CONT
2 CONT Gerhard V Count Of was born about 1277 in Of, Plon, Schleswig-Holstein, Prussia.  He died about 1323.
2 CONT
2 CONT   Waldemar Count Of HOLSTEIN
2 CONT
2 CONT Waldemar Count Of was born about 1279 in Of Plon, Schleswig-Holstein, Prussia.  He died on June 29th, 1308.
