1 NOTE {geni:about_me} "Elsebe [Juel] - died 19 Mar 1602 at Sande, buried in Onsøy Church (coffin plate). '''Married after 1580''' to Lensmand and Ship Captain Peder Brockenhuus of Hovindsholm and Sande (DAA 1962, II, 10-11). (Parents of
2 CONC  Peder: Lensmand Eiler B. of Søndergårde (Vends H.) and Kirsten Eriksdatter Gyldenhorn). Peder died in 1608, before April 28."
2 CONT
2 CONT 1. [https://books.google.ru/books?id=FV6UvjkkD9gC&printsec=frontcover&hl=ru#v=onepage&q&f=false Danmarks Adels Aarbog, 1897.] P. 91.
2 CONT 2. Thiset, Hiort-Lorenzen, Bobé, Teisen, Danmarks Adels Aarbog, [https://slaegtsbibliotek.dk/2024/941649.pdf (Dansk Adelsforening 1884-2020), DAA 2000-02:397, 62 b.] P. 397.
