1 CONT
1 CONT
1 CONT These are heirs-general of Eric, Duke of Sudermannia, and Duke Skule of Norway and Ingeborg of Denmark, Queen of Norway and the two Swedish ladies as ancestresses of House of Mecklenburg.
1 CONT
1 CONT [edit]
1 CONT Future heirs of Scandinavian countries
1 CONT Since she was a pivotal person in genealogies to explain Scandinavian successions and pretensions to thrones, here is a genealogical table of her descendants within a century:
1 CONT
